{"code":"class Solution:\n    def subarraySum(self, arr, target):\n        # code here\n        \n        curr_sum = 0\n        start = 0\n    \n        for end in range(len(arr)):\n            curr_sum += arr[end]\n        \n            while curr_sum > target and start < end:\n                curr_sum -= arr[start]\n                start += 1\n            \n            if curr_sum == target:\n                return [start + 1, end + 1]\n            \n        return [-1]","lang":"python3","pid":701236}